<view class="page lock"><view class="pin" wx:if="{{!code}}"><text class="sub head">算出成本后，按各次平均值记到这一款和关联货号的成本上。</text><input class="find" placeholder="搜索货号" placeholder-class="ph" value="{{q}}" confirm-type="search" bindinput="onFind" /></view><scroll-view class="scroller" scroll-y bindscrolltolower="onMore" lower-threshold="120"><block wx:if="{{!code}}"><view wx:if="{{loaded && !styles.length}}" class="empty">{{q ? '没有匹配的货号' : '还没有成本数据'}}</view><view class="card cost-card" wx:for="{{styles}}" wx:key="productCode" bindtap="onOpen" data-code="{{item.productCode}}"><image wx:if="{{item.coverUrl}}" class="cost-thumb" src="{{item.coverUrl}}" mode="aspectFill" data-code="{{item.productCode}}" data-full="{{item.coverFull}}" catchtap="onPreview" binderror="onCoverError" /><view class="cost-body"><text class="cost-name">{{item.productCode}}</text><view class="cost-codes" wx:if="{{item.memberCodes.length > 1}}"><text class="cost-code" wx:for="{{item.memberCodes}}" wx:for-item="code" wx:key="*this" wx:if="{{code !== item.productCode}}">{{code}}</text></view><text class="cost-empty" wx:if="{{!item.calcAverage && !item.priceAmount}}">未设成本</text></view><view class="cost-side" wx:if="{{item.calcAverage || item.priceAmount}}"><view class="cost-one" wx:if="{{item.calcAverage}}"><text class="cost-k">平均</text><text class="cost-v avg">¥{{item.calcAverage}}</text></view><view class="cost-one" wx:if="{{item.priceAmount}}"><text class="cost-k">理论</text><text class="cost-v">¥{{item.priceAmount}}</text></view></view></view><view class="more-tip" wx:if="{{more}}">上拉加载更多</view></block><block wx:else><view class="card" wx:for="{{styles}}" wx:key="productCode"><view class="style-top"><view class="style-id"><image wx:if="{{item.coverUrl}}" class="style-thumb" src="{{item.coverUrl}}" mode="aspectFill" data-code="{{item.productCode}}" data-full="{{item.coverFull}}" catchtap="onPreview" binderror="onCoverError" /><text class="title" wx:if="{{item.memberCodes.length <= 1}}">{{item.productCode}}</text></view><view class="price-row"><view class="quote" wx:if="{{item.calcAverage}}"><text class="quote-k">平均成本</text><text class="quote-v cost">¥{{item.calcAverage}}</text></view><view class="quote" wx:if="{{item.priceAmount}}"><text class="quote-k">理论成本</text><text class="quote-v">¥{{item.priceAmount}}</text></view></view></view><view class="code-pack" wx:if="{{item.memberCodes.length > 1}}"><image class="link-mark" src="/assets/icons/pe-link.svg" mode="aspectFit" /><text class="code-chip" wx:for="{{item.memberCodes}}" wx:for-item="code" wx:key="*this">{{code}}</text></view><view class="switch"><text class="switch-item {{view === 'style' ? 'on' : ''}}" data-view="style" bindtap="onView">{{i18n.chainStyle}}</text><text class="switch-item {{view === 'sales' ? 'on' : ''}}" data-view="sales" bindtap="onView">{{i18n.chainSales}}</text></view></view><block wx:if="{{view === 'style'}}"><view class="btn" bindtap="onOpenCalc">计算成本</view><block wx:if="{{calcCount}}"><view class="card"><view class="price-row"><view class="quote"><text class="quote-k">平均成本</text><text class="quote-v cost">¥{{calcAverage}}</text></view><view class="quote" wx:if="{{calcArchive}}"><text class="quote-k">理论成本</text><text class="quote-v">¥{{calcArchive}}</text></view></view><text class="sub">各次计算的平均值，已写入这一款和关联货号的成本</text><view class="btn" bindtap="onApplyCalc">{{i18n.writeCodeCost}}</view></view><view class="card" wx:for="{{calcs}}" wx:key="id"><view class="calc-top"><text class="title">{{item.factoryName}}</text><text class="when">{{item.when}}</text></view><text class="sub">裁剪 {{item.basisQty}} 件 · 面料 ¥{{item.fabricText}} · 辅料 ¥{{item.trimText}}{{item.processText ? ' · 加工费 ¥' + item.processText : ''}}</text><view class="price-row"><view class="quote"><text class="quote-k">成本</text><text class="quote-v cost">¥{{item.unitText}}</text></view><view class="quote" wx:if="{{item.archiveText}}"><text class="quote-k">理论成本</text><text class="quote-v">¥{{item.archiveText}}</text></view><text class="calc-del" data-id="{{item.id}}" catchtap="onDeleteCalc">删除</text></view></view></block><view class="card" wx:if="{{facts.length || parts.length}}"><view class="parts" wx:if="{{parts.length}}"><text class="part {{part.kind}}" wx:for="{{parts}}" wx:for-item="part" wx:key="label">{{part.label}} ¥{{part.amount}}</text></view><view class="tiles"><view class="tile" wx:for="{{facts}}" wx:for-item="fact" wx:key="k"><text class="tile-k">{{fact.k}}</text><text class="tile-v">{{fact.v}}</text></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{loaded && !facts.length && !parts.length}}" class="guide"><text class="guide-title">还没有成本价</text><text class="guide-step">1. 先到商品成本，填上这款的加工费。用了面料、辅料，把单件用量也填上。</text><text class="guide-step">2. 到加工厂给这款新建一条裁剪，绑上这次的面料和辅料。</text><text class="guide-step">3. 回到这里点「计算成本」，再点那条裁剪。算出来的价会写到这一款和关联货号上。</text><view class="btn" bindtap="onGuideStyle">去填商品成本</view><view class="btn ghost" bindtap="onGuideCut">去新建裁剪</view></view></block><view class="card" wx:else><view class="hero"><text class="hero-k">{{i18n.saleAmount}}</text><text class="hero-v sales">¥{{sale.amount}}</text></view><text class="sub">{{i18n.saleLinkedNote}}</text><view class="tiles"><view class="tile"><text class="tile-k">{{i18n.saleQty}}</text><text class="tile-v">{{sale.qty}} {{i18n.unitPiece}}</text></view><view class="tile"><text class="tile-k">{{i18n.refundAmount}}</text><text class="tile-v">¥{{sale.refundAmount}}</text></view><view class="tile"><text class="tile-k">{{i18n.refundQty}}</text><text class="tile-v">{{sale.refundQty}} {{i18n.unitPiece}}</text></view></view></view><view class="more-tip" wx:if="{{view === 'style' && more}}">上拉加载更多</view></block><view class="list-end"></view></scroll-view></view><view class="pop-mask" wx:if="{{sheetOn}}" catchtouchmove="noop" bindtap="onCloseSheet"><view class="pop-sheet tall" catchtap="noop"><view class="pop-handle"></view><view class="pop-title"><view class="code-pack" wx:if="{{sheetCodes.length > 1}}"><image class="link-mark" src="/assets/icons/pe-link.svg" mode="aspectFit" /><text class="code-chip" wx:for="{{sheetCodes}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</text></view><text wx:else>{{sheetCode}}</text></view><view class="switch sheet-switch"><text class="switch-item {{view === 'style' ? 'on' : ''}}" data-view="style" bindtap="onView">{{i18n.chainStyle}}</text><text class="switch-item {{view === 'sales' ? 'on' : ''}}" data-view="sales" bindtap="onView">{{i18n.chainSales}}</text></view><scroll-view class="pop-body" scroll-y><block wx:for="{{sheetStyles}}" wx:key="productCode"><view class="card" wx:if="{{item.coverUrl || item.calcAverage || item.priceAmount}}"><view class="style-top" wx:if="{{item.coverUrl || item.calcAverage || item.priceAmount}}"><view class="style-id" wx:if="{{item.coverUrl}}"><image class="style-thumb" src="{{item.coverUrl}}" mode="aspectFill" data-code="{{item.productCode}}" data-full="{{item.coverFull}}" catchtap="onPreview" binderror="onCoverError" /></view><view class="price-row"><view class="quote" wx:if="{{item.calcAverage}}"><text class="quote-k">平均成本</text><text class="quote-v cost">¥{{item.calcAverage}}</text></view><view class="quote" wx:if="{{item.priceAmount}}"><text class="quote-k">理论成本</text><text class="quote-v">¥{{item.priceAmount}}</text></view></view></view></view></block><block wx:if="{{view === 'style'}}"><view class="btn" bindtap="onOpenCalc">计算成本</view><block wx:if="{{sheetCount}}"><view class="card"><view class="price-row"><view class="quote"><text class="quote-k">平均成本</text><text class="quote-v cost">¥{{sheetAverage}}</text></view><view class="quote" wx:if="{{sheetArchive}}"><text class="quote-k">理论成本</text><text class="quote-v">¥{{sheetArchive}}</text></view></view><text class="sub">各次计算的平均值，已写入这一款和关联货号的成本</text><view class="btn" bindtap="onApplyCalc">{{i18n.writeCodeCost}}</view></view><view class="card" wx:for="{{sheetCalcs}}" wx:key="id"><view class="calc-top"><text class="title">{{item.factoryName}}</text><text class="when">{{item.when}}</text></view><text class="sub">裁剪 {{item.basisQty}} 件 · 面料 ¥{{item.fabricText}} · 辅料 ¥{{item.trimText}}{{item.processText ? ' · 加工费 ¥' + item.processText : ''}}</text><view class="price-row"><view class="quote"><text class="quote-k">成本</text><text class="quote-v cost">¥{{item.unitText}}</text></view><view class="quote" wx:if="{{item.archiveText}}"><text class="quote-k">理论成本</text><text class="quote-v">¥{{item.archiveText}}</text></view><text class="calc-del" data-id="{{item.id}}" catchtap="onDeleteCalc">删除</text></view></view></block><view class="card" wx:if="{{facts.length || parts.length}}"><view class="parts" wx:if="{{parts.length}}"><text class="part {{part.kind}}" wx:for="{{parts}}" wx:for-item="part" wx:key="label">{{part.label}} ¥{{part.amount}}</text></view><view class="tiles"><view class="tile" wx:for="{{facts}}" wx:for-item="fact" wx:key="k"><text class="tile-k">{{fact.k}}</text><text class="tile-v">{{fact.v}}</text></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{!facts.length && !parts.length}}" class="guide"><text class="guide-title">还没有成本价</text><text class="guide-step">1. 先到商品成本，填上这款的加工费。用了面料、辅料，把单件用量也填上。</text><text class="guide-step">2. 到加工厂给这款新建一条裁剪，绑上这次的面料和辅料。</text><text class="guide-step">3. 回到这里点「计算成本」，再点那条裁剪。算出来的价会写到这一款和关联货号上。</text><view class="btn" bindtap="onGuideStyle">去填商品成本</view><view class="btn ghost" bindtap="onGuideCut">去新建裁剪</view></view></block><view class="card" wx:else><view class="hero"><text class="hero-k">{{i18n.saleAmount}}</text><text class="hero-v sales">¥{{sale.amount}}</text></view><text class="sub">{{i18n.saleLinkedNote}}</text><view class="tiles"><view class="tile"><text class="tile-k">{{i18n.saleQty}}</text><text class="tile-v">{{sale.qty}} {{i18n.unitPiece}}</text></view><view class="tile"><text class="tile-k">{{i18n.refundAmount}}</text><text class="tile-v">¥{{sale.refundAmount}}</text></view><view class="tile"><text class="tile-k">{{i18n.refundQty}}</text><text class="tile-v">{{sale.refundQty}} {{i18n.unitPiece}}</text></view></view></view><view class="pop-pad"></view></scroll-view></view></view><view class="pop-mask front" wx:if="{{calcOn}}" catchtouchmove="noop" bindtap="onCloseCalc"><view class="pop-sheet tall" catchtap="noop"><view class="pop-handle"></view><text class="pop-title">计算成本</text><scroll-view class="pop-body" scroll-y bindscrolltolower="onCalcMore" lower-threshold="120"><view class="field" wx:if="{{calcCode}}"><view class="calc-top"><view class="code-pack" wx:if="{{calcCodes.length > 1}}"><image class="link-mark" src="/assets/icons/pe-link.svg" mode="aspectFit" /><text class="code-chip" wx:for="{{calcCodes}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</text></view><view class="code-line" wx:else><image wx:if="{{calcLinked}}" class="link-mark" src="/assets/icons/pe-link.svg" mode="aspectFit" /><text class="title">{{calcCode}}</text></view><text class="hint" bindtap="onClearStyle">全部裁剪</text></view></view><input wx:else class="find" placeholder="搜索货号" placeholder-class="ph" value="{{calcQuery}}" confirm-type="search" bindinput="onCalcQuery" /><text class="sub" wx:if="{{cutCosts.length}}">成本 =（这次面料 + 这次辅料）/ 裁剪件数 + 这款加工费。点一条裁剪就计算。</text><view wx:if="{{calcReady && !cutCosts.length}}" class="guide"><text class="guide-title">还算不出成本价</text><text class="guide-step">1. 先到商品成本，填上这款的加工费。用了面料、辅料，把单件用量也填上。</text><text class="guide-step">2. 到加工厂给这款新建一条裁剪，绑上这次的面料和辅料。</text><text class="guide-step">3. 回到这里点那条裁剪。算出来的价会写到这一款和关联货号上。</text><view class="btn" bindtap="onGuideStyle">去填商品成本</view><view class="btn ghost" bindtap="onGuideCut">去新建裁剪</view></view><view class="cost-pick" wx:for="{{cutCosts}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onUseCut"><view class="code-line"><image wx:if="{{item.linked}}" class="link-mark" src="/assets/icons/pe-link.svg" mode="aspectFit" /><text class="cost-pick-name">{{item.productCode}}{{item.factoryName ? ' · ' + item.factoryName : ''}}</text></view><text class="cost-pick-meta">面料 ¥{{item.fabricText}} · 辅料 ¥{{item.trimText}} · 加工费 ¥{{item.processText}} · {{item.qtyText}} 件</text><text class="cost-pick-meta">{{item.missing ? item.missing : '成本 ¥' + item.unitText}}</text></view><view class="more-tip" wx:if="{{calcMore}}">上拉加载更多</view><view class="pop-pad"></view></scroll-view></view></view>
